<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Are You the One my heart has known?</l><l>Are You the One, my spirit has richly grown to love?</l><l>Oh come, Beloved</l><l>And with my lips, shall I confess</l><l>That deep in You my heart found rest</l><l>And peace as ocean’s depth?</l><l>Oh, fill me with Your breath!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
